    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0262",
      "reading_order": 318,
      "section": "3.4.3 LBS (Load Bus Synchronization)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 370.8576629101563,
        "r": 541.3824799999993,
        "b": 314.586101363195
      },
      "content": "Dual bus system is composed of two independent UPS systems and each UPS system can be composed  of  one  or  more  parallel  stand-alone  UPS.  Dual  bus  system  with  high  reliability  is applicable to load with multiple input terminals. For single input load, one optional static transfer switch (STS) can be added for load power supply.",
      "section_id": "sec_3_4_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_3_4",
      "section_level": 3,
      "section_path": [
        {
